Never mind, I realized I had to change the code a little bit since it came from metadata and not from drag and drop. This one worked well:

check.folders <- checkSpeciesIdentification(inDir               = "C:/Users/Panthera01/Pictures/CT/No_orginales/Buscadores",

                                            IDfrom              = "metadata",
                                            metadataSpeciesTag  = "Species",

                                            hasCameraFolders    = FALSE,
                                            maxDeltaTime        = 120,
                                            stationsToCheck     = c("CamJaime", "CamEfrain"))
check.folders

